{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/10624","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/10624/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/10624/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/10624/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/10624","id":2111060910,"node_id":"I_kwDOBG8K98591Duu","number":10624,"title":"Psalm errorBaseline config not respected when given paths","user":{"login":"gready-hub","id":6576838,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzY4Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6576838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub","html_url":"https://github.com/gready-hub","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gready-hub/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-01-31T22:08:29Z","updated_at":"2024-02-01T04:36:32Z","closed_at":"2024-02-01T01:06:14Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi there. I've found this to break how the error baseline is used. Due to the removal of the trailing `/` from the config path Psalm does not locate the files from the error baseline due too this one missing character.\r\n\r\nEither the generate baseline needs to add the prefix or we need to remove the prefix `/` when checking if the path is in the `$issues_baseline` map.\r\n\r\nFrom `src/Psalm/Internal/Cli/Psalm.php`\r\n```php\r\n        if ($paths_to_check !== null) {\r\n            $filtered_issue_baseline = [];\r\n            foreach ($paths_to_check as $path_to_check) {\r\n                // These two lines below are the problem... \r\n                $path_to_check = substr($path_to_check, strlen($config->base_dir));\r\n                if (isset($issue_baseline[$path_to_check])) {\r\n                    $filtered_issue_baseline[$path_to_check] = $issue_baseline[$path_to_check];\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n            $issue_baseline = $filtered_issue_baseline;\r\n        }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis resolves the issue I have been experiencing... Either increment by one or remove prefix `/` prior.\r\n```\r\n// ...\r\n$path_to_check = substr($path_to_check, strlen($config->base_dir) + 1);\r\n// ...\r\n```\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @gready-hub in https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/10542#issuecomment-1920052525_\r\n            ","closed_by":{"login":"weirdan","id":57403,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NDAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan","html_url":"https://github.com/weirdan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weirdan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/w